This program is an independent Markdown utility. Its native renderer is an
independent Mermaid implementation and may produce different layouts or
support different syntax from the official Mermaid JavaScript renderer.

Dependency versions are recorded in Cargo.lock. Release archives include
the dependency license texts in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt, generated from
that lockfile during packaging.
